{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Suggestion chip is a UI element that allows to present recommended or predictive options based on user’s input or context,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and is commonly used to capture filtering decisions."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Suggestion chip is typically non-selected by default and can be tapped or clicked to apply the suggestion, streamlining input and enhancing usability."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOSuggestionChip"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/Controls"],"kind":"mentions"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This component does not define in its side some accessibility hints. If you use this component, you must define such hints so as to explain"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to your users which actions are available for which interactions."}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Icon only","    MISOSuggestionChip(image: MISOImage(asset: Image(\"ic_heart\")), accessibilityLabel: \"Heart\") {}","","    \/\/ Icon only, raw image (not tinte